Server init.
>> a := Blob tuntun: 4.
a bytes: ( Akojọ tuntun ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob tuntun: 4.
b bytes: ( Akojọ tuntun ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will retur
>> c := a tuntun.
{ 
>> n := a ^ c.
Ijade kọ: ['xorred:'], ila-tuntun. 
Ijade kọ: n, ila-tuntun. 
} mu: { :e Ijade kọ: e, ila-tuntun. }, bẹrẹ.
a tu-silẹ.
b tu-silẹ.
